      {
       "id": "e5fea51",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "title": "The Ummah Builders <em>manifesto</em>",
        "header_size": "h1",
        "_css_classes": "ub-title",
        "align": "center"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "heading"
      },
      {
       "id": "3e6f3d6",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "space": {
         "unit": "px",
         "size": 20,
         "sizes": []
        }
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "spacer"
      },
      {
       "id": "6b0d217",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "editor": "<p>We want to build a strong and honest professional network for the ummah: a place where people come together to learn, to build and to help each other grow.</p>",
        "align": "center"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "text-editor"
      },
      {
       "id": "835d94f",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "space": {
         "unit": "px",
         "size": 40,
         "sizes": []
        }
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "spacer"
      },
      {
       "id": "42a061b",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "title": "I. Within Islamic boundaries",
        "header_size": "h2",
        "_css_classes": "ub-step-title"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "heading"
      },
      {
       "id": "711ceaa",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "editor": "<p>Everything we do happens within clear Islamic boundaries: in how we treat each other, money and data.</p>"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "text-editor"
      },
      {
       "id": "e046e4c",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "space": {
         "unit": "px",
         "size": 20,
         "sizes": []
        }
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "spacer"
      },
      {
       "id": "9111ff5",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "title": "II. Quality and knowledge",
        "header_size": "h2",
        "_css_classes": "ub-step-title"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "heading"
      },
      {
       "id": "30dce38",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "editor": "<p>We choose substance over noise. Structured conversations, a shared knowledge base and mentoring by experienced professionals.</p>"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "text-editor"
      },
      {
       "id": "64bb518",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "space": {
         "unit": "px",
         "size": 20,
         "sizes": []
        }
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "spacer"
      },
      {
       "id": "6a001cc",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "title": "III. Real impact",
        "header_size": "h2",
        "_css_classes": "ub-step-title"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "heading"
      },
      {
       "id": "7f01b25",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "editor": "<p>The talent within the ummah is vast but scattered. Through project groups, hackathons and shark-tank sessions we turn ideas into working projects.</p>"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "text-editor"
      },
      {
       "id": "7a004f5",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "space": {
         "unit": "px",
         "size": 20,
         "sizes": []
        }
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "spacer"
      },
      {
       "id": "2969e3a",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "title": "IV. An example for the youth",
        "header_size": "h2",
        "_css_classes": "ub-step-title"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "heading"
      },
      {
       "id": "c03deb9",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "editor": "<p>We want to be positive role models, so young people do not depend on the wrong examples. Members share their career ladder so others see what is possible.</p>"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "text-editor"
      },
      {
       "id": "7039eb3",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "space": {
         "unit": "px",
         "size": 20,
         "sizes": []
        }
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "spacer"
      },
      {
       "id": "19a2a57",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "title": "V. What we do not do",
        "header_size": "h2",
        "_css_classes": "ub-step-title"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "heading"
      },
      {
       "id": "66d345b",
       "elType": "widget",
       "settings": {
        "editor": "<p>No addictive algorithm, no DM culture and no misuse of data. Money that flows through the community is reported transparently.</p>"
       },
       "elements": [],
       "widgetType": "text-editor"
      },
      {
       "id": "7746b70",
